      "message": "Could you briefly describe why this is needed?\n\n1. Whenever there is a change in the mux state, EC_HOST_EVENT_USB_MUX and hc_usb_pd_mux_info() will get triggered.\n2. We are already stuffing the enabled bit in the host command. In case of disconnect, shouldn\u0027t this\nalready be 0 since we are checking for communication enabled, device connected and partner is PD capable?\n3. This patch might not work for boards not supporting virtual mux",
