      "message": "Thanks Ayushee for the queries and for the quick response.\n[1]. Yes, we are sending the host event whenever there is a change in Mux state. The current design works if the PD, MUX EC commands from AP comes before EC updates the current Mux state to next state.\n\n[2]. I think second query also same as first one. \n\n[3]. This patch will work for all boards. The main function calls have check that checks virtual mux is enabled or not. if not enabled it will send false.\n\nIf my responses are not answered to your queries we can have meeting for discussing more and lets target for better code",
